He knows that changing sensitivity isn't necessarily
a detriment to skill.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:54.910
But he does note how once you find a grip,
position, and posture that works for you,

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:59.699
staying consistent with it will help you reach
